---
description: Use Yarn 4 (via Corepack) only, never npm/pnpm
globs: package.json, yarn.lock
alwaysApply: true
---

# Package Manager Rules

- The repo pins Yarn 4 in `package.json` (`"packageManager": "yarn@4.18.1"`). Run
  `corepack enable` once, then use `yarn` — never npm, pnpm, or a global Yarn 1.
- Install in CI / clean checkouts with `yarn install --immutable`.
- Never manually edit yarn.lock; keep its changes minimal when adding deps.
- Registry must be https://registry.yarnpkg.com
